---
/* About, written as writing. The old version was a two column table of key and
   value, which reads as a form somebody filled in rather than a person talking.
   The live Detroit clock stays: it is the one honest thing on the page that
   only exists because you happen to be looking at it right now. */
---
<section class="section about" id="about" data-accent="#f25c1f" data-face="(｡•ᴗ•｡)">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-say">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">About</p>
      <h2 class="t-display head reveal" data-split="lines">Robotics is where all of this started.</h2>
      <div class="prose reveal">
        <p>
          I did VEX as a freshman and we went to Worlds, and then I left with four
          other people to start a FIRST team from nothing. That meant teaching myself
          wiring, computer vision and how to call a stranger and ask them for money,
          because there was no mentor and no budget and we needed all three.
        </p>
        <p>
          The software came out of that. We kept needing things that did not exist
          yet, so I started making them, and I have not really stopped. Everything on
          this page came from the same habit.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am a senior at the school, I speak English and Mandarin, and I am applying
          to college this fall.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-side reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow side-lbl">What I reach for</p>
      <ul class="stack-line mono" aria-label="Tools">{["Swift","SwiftUI","AppKit","TypeScript","Next.js","React","Supabase","Stripe","Python","FastAPI"].map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ul>
      <p class="side-note">
        Right now, where I am, it is <time class="num" data-clock-long>&hellip;</time>.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { padding-block: clamp(72px, 10vw, 150px); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(240px, .75fr); gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px); align-items: start; }
  .about-say { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .head { max-width: 15ch; margin: 6px 0 20px; }

  .about-side { display: grid; gap: 14px; align-content: start; padding-top: 8px; border-top: .5px solid var(--rule); }
  .side-lbl { padding-top: 18px; }
  .stack-line { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.9; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 13px; }
  .stack-line li + li::before { content: '·'; margin-right: 13px; color: var(--hair); }
  .side-note { font-size: var(--t-small); color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 6px; border-top: .5px solid var(--rule); }
  .side-note time { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; } .head { max-width: 18ch; } }
</style>
